# d2-build-helper — Overview

## Tech Stack

- Kotlin 2.0.0 + Compose Multiplatform 1.6.11
- AGP 8.3.0, Android minSdk 24 / targetSdk 34 / compileSdk 34
- Java target 1.8
- Apollo Kotlin 4.0.0-beta.6 — Stratz GraphQL
- Supabase Storage 2.5.0 — hero/item/ability icons
- Ktor 2.3.11 — CIO on Android+JVM, Darwin on iOS
- Coil 3.0.0-alpha06 — image loading
- kotlinx.coroutines 1.9.0-RC, kotlinx.serialization 1.7.0
- compose-viewmodel 2.8.2, compose-navigation 2.8.0-alpha02

Several core deps are pinned to alpha/beta/RC releases. Before upgrading or adding deps, check the compatibility matrix in `mobile-roadmap.mdc`.

## Module Layout

Single module: `:composeApp`. Targets `androidTarget()`, `jvm()`, `iosX64()`, `iosArm64()`, `iosSimulatorArm64()`. Multi-module split is planned but out of scope for current work.

```
composeApp/src/
├── commonMain/kotlin/dev/nonoxy/d2buildhelper/
│   ├── App.kt
│   ├── theme/
│   ├── base/
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── di/
│   │   ├── data/
│   │   └── graphql/
│   ├── common/utils/
│   ├── features/
│   └── navigation/
├── commonMain/composeResources/
│   ├── values/strings.xml
│   ├── files/constants/{heroes,items,abilities}.json
│   └── font/
├── androidMain/kotlin/...
├── iosMain/kotlin/...
├── jvmMain/kotlin/...
└── commonTest/kotlin/...
```

`build-logic/` is a composite build with shared Gradle utilities (`AppVersion`, `GitCommitCountValueSource`, `JsonSerializationPlugin`). It exists so future convention plugins land in one place; feature build scripts currently apply gradle plugins directly via aliases.

## Naming Conventions

Package root: `dev.nonoxy.d2buildhelper`.

| Entity | Pattern | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ViewModel | `{Feature}ViewModel` | `GuidesViewModel` |
| Screen composable | `{Feature}Screen` | `GuidesScreen` |
| View composable | `{Feature}View` | `GuidesView` |
| Sub-views directory | `views/` | `guides/presentation/ui/views/` |
| ViewState sealed class | `{Feature}ViewState` | `GuidesViewState` |
| Action sealed class | `{Feature}Action` | `GuidesAction` |
| Event sealed class | `{Feature}Event` | `GuidesEvent` |
| UseCase | `{Verb}{Subject}UseCase` | `GetGuidesUseCase`, `GetImagesUseCase` |
| Remote DTO (GraphQL) | `{Entity}` in `core/data/api/{topic}/models/` | `Guide`, `DetailGuide` |
| UI/domain model | `{Entity}UI` in `features/{feature}/domain/models/` | `GuideUI`, `HeroUI` |
| Repository | `{Topic}Repository` | `ResourcesRepository` |
| DataSource interface | `{Topic}Api` | `GuidesApi`, `ImageResourcesApi` |
| DataSource impl | `{Topic}DataSource` | `GuidesDataSource`, `ImageResourcesDataSource` |
| Mapper file | `{Topic}Mappers.kt` | `GuideMappers.kt` |

## Existing Features

- `features/guides/` — list of high-rated builds for a hero (Stratz GraphQL + Supabase icons + local hero JSON).
- `features/detailGuide/` — placeholder screen for a single build, not yet implemented.

Navigation routes are declared in `navigation/AppScreens.kt` as a sealed class of route strings. `LocalNavHost` exposes the `NavHostController` to children.
